option.EXPOSURE=Exposure (stops)
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.TEMPERATURE=Temperature
option.TINT=Tint
option.GRAYSCALE=Grayscale
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Brightness in stops. Zero leaves the scene unchanged.
option.SATURATION.comment=One is neutral. Zero removes color.
option.CONTRAST.comment=One is neutral. Adjusts contrast around mid-gray.
option.TEMPERATURE.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative is cooler; positive is warmer.
option.TINT.comment=Zero is neutral. Negative adds green; positive adds magenta.
option.GRAYSCALE.comment=Optional weighted grayscale after other color controls.
